# Wallet Platform Integration Guide
## www.grudgeplatform.com/wallet → GRUDA Node App Integration

### Overview

The GRUDA Wallet Platform (www.grudgeplatform.com/wallet) serves as the primary interface for operating GRD-17 nodes. When users visit this URL, they are redirected to a comprehensive node management application that provides full control over their GRUDA blockchain operations.

---

## Architecture Overview

```
User Access Flow:
www.grudgeplatform.com/wallet
           ↓
    [Authentication Layer]
           ↓
    [Node Discovery Service]
           ↓
    [GRD-17 Node Interface]
           ↓
    [Wallet Operations Dashboard]
```

### Platform Components

1. **Web Interface** (grudgeplatform.com/wallet)
2. **Node Discovery Service** (finds user's node)
3. **GRD-17 Node Application** (this application)
4. **Blockchain Network** (GRUDA mainnet)
5. **Mining Pool Integration**
6. **Cross-chain Bridges**

