## Platform Integration Endpoints

### 1. Node Discovery API

```bash
# Discover user's node
POST https://api.grudgeplatform.com/v1/node/discover
Headers:
  Authorization: Bearer <user_token>
  Content-Type: application/json

Body:
{
  "wallet_address": "gruda1abc...",
  "node_preference": "nearest|fastest|cheapest"
}

Response:
{
  "node_endpoints": [
    {
      "node_id": "grd17-node-001",
      "endpoint": "https://node1.gruda.network:8545",
      "location": "us-west-2",
      "latency": 15,
      "reliability": 99.9
    }
  ],
  "recommended": "grd17-node-001"
}
```

