## Integration Workflows

### 1. Initial User Onboarding

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant W as Wallet Platform
    participant N as Node Discovery
    participant G as GRD-17 Node
    
    U->>W: Visit grudgeplatform.com/wallet
    W->>U: Show wallet connection options
    U->>W: Connect wallet (MetaMask/Phantom)
    W->>N: Request node discovery
    N->>W: Return available nodes
    W->>G: Establish connection
    G->>W: Return node status
    W->>U: Show dashboard
```

### 2. Mining Operations Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant W as Wallet Platform
    participant G as GRD-17 Node
    participant P as Mining Pool
    
    U->>W: Click "Start Mining"
    W->>G: Send mining command
    G->>P: Connect to pool
    P->>G: Send work
    G->>P: Submit shares
    P->>G: Confirm rewards
    G->>W: Update statistics
    W->>U: Show mining status
```

### 3. Cross-Chain Transfer Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant W as Wallet Platform
    participant G as GRD-17 Node
    participant B as Bridge Contract
    participant T as Target Chain
    
    U->>W: Initiate transfer
    W->>G: Validate transaction
    G->>B: Lock source tokens
    B->>T: Mint target tokens
    T->>W: Confirm completion
    W->>U: Show success
```

