## Troubleshooting Guide

### Common Issues

1. **Wallet Connection Failed**
   ```bash
   # Check network connectivity
   curl -I https://grudgeplatform.com/wallet
   
   # Verify SSL certificate
   openssl s_client -connect grudgeplatform.com:443
   
   # Clear browser cache and cookies
   # Try different wallet provider
   ```

2. **Node Discovery Timeout**
   ```bash
   # Check node discovery service
   curl https://discovery.grudgeplatform.com/health
   
   # Verify node registration
   ./gruda-node platform status
   
   # Re-register if needed
   ./gruda-node platform register --force
   ```

3. **Mining Not Starting**
   ```bash
   # Check mining pool connectivity
   telnet pool.gruda.mining 4444
   
   # Verify worker credentials
   ./gruda-node mining test-auth
   
   # Check GPU/CPU availability
   ./gruda-node mining hardware-check
   ```

